<title>CHINA: Mongolia says it exports oil for first time.</title>
<headline>Mongolia says it exports oil for first time.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia, long heavily dependent on imports of oil, has exported oil for the first time, the Xinhua news agency said in a report from the capital, Ulan Bator.</p>
<p>Mongolia had exported 15,900 litres of oil on December 12, the report said. It did not say where Mongolia exported the oil to and gave no other details.</p>
</text>
